/// Backoff before empty-hiccup retry [attempt] (0-based): exponential from the base, capped — the same shape as the model-roles retry policy (500ms → 8s cap).
Duration emptyHiccupBackoffFor(int attempt, {required Duration baseDelay, required Duration maxBackoff}) {
  var ms = baseDelay.inMilliseconds * (1 << attempt.clamp(0, 20));
  if (ms > maxBackoff.inMilliseconds) ms = maxBackoff.inMilliseconds;
  return Duration(milliseconds: ms);
}
```

